{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PsfaKMJWxL1792420829.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民銀行調高外匯存款準備金率。</p><p></p><p>人民銀行宣布自11月15日起，調高金融機構外匯存款準備金率2個百分點，由現行百分之4，調高至百分之6。比率上調後，有望收緊銀行體系內美元流動性，從而緩和人民幣匯率升值壓力。</p><p></p><p>比率對上一次上調要追溯至2021年，當時同樣上調2個百分點。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.411445+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T01:18:36.982939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:39.189183+00:00","content_hash":"8eb8aaac04ad54b54e51f7547958e4695a3297879981bd90ddd2c399f6a0a93d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.411445+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}